# The build context for deploy/docker/Dockerfile is the repository root, and the build
# stage runs `pnpm install` itself. Everything a working checkout accumulates is therefore
# cost without use — and `.orca` would be somebody's event store, copied into an image.
node_modules
**/node_modules
dist
**/dist
*.tsbuildinfo
**/*.tsbuildinfo
.orca
**/.orca
coverage
test-results
playwright-report
.git
